[{"title":"惟车八章　广小什也","author":"邱云霄","text":"惟车有辅，周道康兮。\n维樯有䈏，济江长兮。\n顾辅不设，中坎坎兮。\n载沈载浮，怀漾漾兮。\n瞻彼林躅，饱将弃馀。\n绵蛮之止，举斯戒危。\n嗟嗟扑满，显窍以入。\n如车有籊，隆然张蔽。\n百尔君子，视典章兮。\n皇祖有赫，贻宪昌兮。\n毋谓不知，抑若扬兮。\n毋苟女比，众且狂兮。\n直言孔武，织言如组。\n维彼克佞，如携如取。\n维此贞人，迸言如毒。\n昊天震怒，云胡以惧。\n众口铄金，胡不斯畏。\n毋云尔功，功有所由成。\n毋云尔才，才有所由名。\n匪幽不克，上下胥征。\n庶邦卒疹，孰哀我员。\n谁谓坤广，云不可往。\n谁谓砥平，足缩缩其有行。\n戒哉我友，驾言孔艰。\n毋尔斯驰，执敬反反。\n夕斯永矣，我是用悲。\n缤缤揔揔，百忧以集。\n日之昃矣，旦其莫矣。\n大车斯轰，尘将及矣。\n今者若褒，行谓筮矣。\n天有所短，无昏不旦。\n地有所病，无陂不平。\n直兹孔畏，眚岂在人。\n悠悠我宰，爰瘁厥伦。\n君子敬止，不念有生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6925,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"停云八章　书所怀也","author":"邱云霄","text":"停云初隮，曰维在南。\n彼美怀人，实民所瞻。\n诡随不克，正直是肩。\n胡斯违斯，谓时则然。\n驾言騑騑，云迈芝田。\n停云在南，瞻望有长。\n彼美人兮，我心孔伤。\n翼翼其猷，蔚蔚其章。\n有邦之则，下民之将。\n胡斯违斯，不念帝疆。\n停云其霭，载张如盖。\n嗟我有怀，言车云迈。\n众异厥趋，我心不改。\n秕既收之，胡不扬稗。\n中心丑之，而谓我怪。\n瞻彼云兮，倾而扬兮。\n我之怀兮，胡斯去之。\n鉴不蔽媸，衡胡以欺。\n汝罔不忌，胡此之忌。\n悠悠有怀，靡我思长。\n怛彼流泉，不平不坎。\n人云则是，畴谓其罔。\n嗟彼觉人，逝焉斯往。\n瞻彼四方，我心殷殷。\n彼其之子，亦哲且崇。\n厥由如弓，好憎如轮。\n顾逵胥轨，畴驰不从。\n梧桐华只，飘风聿至。\n昔斯芳斯，郁其有比。\n玄鸿矫矫，黄羽喈喈。\n音其可怀矣，冥不可致矣。\n我心则鉴，不可以自瑩。\n我心则度，不可以自均。\n言不克晦，眚将女从。\n维江有芷，维林有芎。\n佩斯服斯，爰永厥龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6926,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卿云四章　书所见也","author":"邱云霄","text":"卿云英英，出自方东。\n絪缊之组，昭回有融。\n君曰自帝，臣曰自君。\n上下攸格，无微不通。\n正直维弼，诡随无容。\n庶邦之庆，万姓之祯。\n卿云丽丽，东方自出。\n鞙其有长，矫如凤翼。\n天不爱宝，维帝成之。\n下民徂饥，我是用刺。\n璨璨天章，而莫可食。\n卿云皇皇，瞻言在南。\n载机载杼，天孙之将。\n绚其綵矣，在天之纲。\n望不可即，胡莫以裳。\n卿云其蔚，载瞻其瑞。\n缅彼有怀，我心如缕。\n下民孔艰，槁其穑事。\n维云变态，卷舒朝莫。\n载发其祥，好风好雨。\n今者之兆，来者之惠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6927,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芃芃斯蔗四章　寿冯司徒郎也","author":"邱云霄","text":"芃芃斯蔗，有旨且甘。\n彼美君子，洵修孔扬。\n脍炙我人，嗜服不忘。\n敬哉昭事，爰锡无疆。\n芃芃斯蔗，实红实紫。\n彼美君子，颜其渥赭。\n颐厥天和，中心达若。\n令仪孔淑，尔介尔祉。\n芃芃斯蔗，民用需只。\n彼美君子，爰究厥泽。\n侯施斯溥，畴民不宅。\n维民动天，维天无斁。\n芃芃斯蔗，节言次升。\n彼美君子，斯迈斯征。\n以介期耄，孔茂厥龄。\n如川之逝，遐进不盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6928,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山有泉四章　赠友也","author":"邱云霄","text":"山有泉毖，于其阴。\n君子乐胥，言濯其缨。\n优之游之，逝耽尔清。\n逝耽尔清，以卒斯盟。\n山有泉毖，于其腹。\n君子乐胥，载濯我足。\n我心孔契，嗜此幽独。\n嗜此幽独，伊谁云告。\n山有泉毖，于其趾。\n君子乐胥，言盥其耳。\n无尘有聪，我心则喜。\n逝彼颓流，载忧靡靡。\n山有泉毖，于其门。\n君子乐胥，言洗其心。\n有郁中林，杜彼俗辕。\n从我攸好，永以相敦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6929,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嗟嗟一章章十二句　咏屈平也","author":"邱云霄","text":"嗟嗟贵戚，顾义瞿瞿。\n忠不见售，忧心如旟。\n彼昏既酣，进谗如醵。\n舍此兰茝，佩彼蒿蒌。\n宁汩清流，爰丧我躯。\n翼翼宗庙，忍见丘墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6930,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赫赫一章章十句　咏留侯也","author":"邱云霄","text":"赫赫留侯，万夫之特。\n博浪之椎，豫让之节。\n依汉灭秦，厥忠乃烈。\n抱贞不渝，藏用于默。\n殚心刘庭，为韩报德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6931,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有烨咏一章章八句　靖节也","author":"邱云霄","text":"有烨黄花，味同隐逸。\n爰赋归来，载饮以适。\n五斗非轻，万钟不益。\n君臣义明，我心匪石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6932,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙卧一章章十句　咏武侯也","author":"邱云霄","text":"龙卧南阳，与世相忘。\n风云三顾，矫然翱翔。\n鼎势已成，既明且将。\n义不两立，我武用张。\n鞠躬尽瘁，赍志扬扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6933,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有鹊四章　志来巢也","author":"邱云霄","text":"有鹊唶唶，巢我庭树。\n绸之缪之，亦孔斯固。\n占彼天风，有比其户。\n于焉宿宿，于焉呴呴。\n惟枝翘翘，惟风飘摇。\n爰集所止，并坐其樛。\n聿彼鸠鸟，毋窥我有。\n人各其能，汝心孔丑。\n岂无他林，亦有芳枝。\n或往或来，不如子忘机。\n惟丘有隅，黄鸟止之。\n相彼海翁，白鸥下之。\n惟鹊有灵，载卜其声。\n爰啄我屋，怀彼好音。\n祸福有媒，敢不敬躬。\n惟尔之鸣，实省我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6934,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦奉制早候朝贺","author":"邱云霄","text":"风回鼓角动春晴，天入楼台瑞霭生。\n虬漏声寒迟五夜，龙墀星影转孤城。\n红云冉冉开仙仗，紫极亭亭仰圣明。\n草莽喜逢尧舜日，空怀浅薄负升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6935,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中","author":"邱云霄","text":"茆堂客去山逾静，花径云开水自流。\n昌歜石边灵节长，伏苓松下暗丝浮。\n仙人时见骑黄鹤，野老长眠傍白鸥。\n懒向参同问玄圃，应知閒处即丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6936,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归芗溪","author":"邱云霄","text":"爱汝尚年少，清才羡老成。\n青宵檠独冷，白日剑长鸣。\n归梦连云远，离愁逐雨生。\n含香梅尚蕊，笑折赠君行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6937,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简黄新泉求竹栽","author":"邱云霄","text":"长抱山林癖，何因避俗哗。\n有窗堪种竹，无地可移家。\n传本分香雨，移根动翠霞。\n红尘飞不断，草榻借深遮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6938,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁少府报政 其一","author":"邱云霄","text":"二月轻寒荐客衣，东风吹雨上征旂。\n一川烟草迷行骑，万里春帆共落晖。\n卧月频牵南国梦，看云时采北山薇。\n九重声佩迎天仗，午夜郎星照琐闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6939,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁少府报政 其二","author":"邱云霄","text":"游烟郭外牵晴绿，折柳江头带雨青。\n黄鸟初飞归越客，彩云深处是燕京。\n庭閒月色疏松落，梦绕关河短剑横。\n朝罢丹墀输隐瘼，休言青简滞儒生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6940,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起 其一","author":"邱云霄","text":"青山无负谢玄晖，病入新年药力微。\n睡起不知春早晚，桃花飞后柳花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6941,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起 其二","author":"邱云霄","text":"东风无力上帘钩，独倚檐晖曝短裘。\n草满閒阶无客到，白云长为碧山留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6942,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉陪侍御章介庵先生游武夷夜宿冲佑观","author":"邱云霄","text":"几片红桃乱水浔，仙源窕窈翠云阴。\n花迎玉节低垂涧，鸟避青骢远度林。\n岩草洞芝三月暮，孤松独鹤百年心。\n相看浮世空悲梗，话入双灯夜雨深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6943,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得","author":"邱云霄","text":"青编白酒养疏慵，山逐云深第几重。\n献赋梦无金马诏，知心许有玉龙筇。\n刻痕验长看新竹，扫翠留阴卧老松。\n机事久忘能自信，案头长有野禽踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6944,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫春陪沈拾遗汎舟九曲","author":"邱云霄","text":"登临独爱谢玄晖，风雅千年杜拾遗。\n蓬岛夜篝惊梦寐，舞雩春服愧追随。\n断云飞鸟相持落，曲水层峰两竞奇。\n廊庙江湖成异感，可堪兰棹晚还移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6945,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送虞方山之京师","author":"邱云霄","text":"碧雨生春树，青云接帝台。\n深惭袁炳遇，独爱伯生才。\n秀淑开南岳，文章动北台。\n年来长送客，燕望重徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6946,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送于成弟之掾松溪","author":"邱云霄","text":"柳色散晴烟，江花媚客船。\n春鸿鸣不断，池草梦长县。\n诗礼传先业，萧曹看女贤。\n长安多路达，天阔漫腾骞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6947,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周仰峰主政访武夷别日诗以送之 其一","author":"邱云霄","text":"丹壑幽栖祗自慵，白云深处笑相逢。\n风高律调愁春鸟，波照旌旄骇卧龙。\n携月漫从周茂叔，朋舟应愧郭林宗。\n金台翠谷惊离梦，玉女峰寒望汝容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6948,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周仰峰主政访武夷别日诗以送之 其二","author":"邱云霄","text":"满林红雨抱春愁，几卷青编共此丘。\n綵鹢溪头新使节，绿杨矶畔旧渔钩。\n对君空有江湖梦，清世元无凤鸟忧。\n北去相逢如有问，休言深泽见羊裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6949,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登天游观同沈少泉给事","author":"邱云霄","text":"风流最爱沈休文，结束相攀入碧云。\n霞磴高悬仙岛迥，星槎直汎玉河濆。\n虬松落翠春长静，凤管生寒日欲曛。\n已向浮生了机事，岩花溪鸟笑相群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6950,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"邱云霄","text":"流莺叫晴鸠叫雨，山中不断山禽语。\n睡起开门复闭门，落花落尽春归去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6951,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘吴二子过访留莫酌时天高气清河流月满而饮兴方豪复取酒进舟九曲","author":"邱云霄","text":"沙白月在地，林深叶暗蹊。\n山随溪共转，峰与句争奇。\n鱼跃天枢动，江空斗汉垂。\n归来何处鹤，翻露下松枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6952,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其一","author":"邱云霄","text":"溪萦九曲锁玄关，山拥千峰密似盘。\n漫忆紫阳归去后，一川风月要人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6953,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其二","author":"邱云霄","text":"一曲清歌解木兰，水光摇动万山寒。\n幔亭舞罢秋台燕，野月溪云空汉坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6954,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其三","author":"邱云霄","text":"二曲娇峰云水间，淡妆低压碧云鬟。\n玉容不改春愁重，妆镜台空舞翠鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6955,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其四","author":"邱云霄","text":"三曲虹桥最上头，三杯石外望仙舟。\n莫疑汉使河源路，信有浮槎到女牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6956,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其五","author":"邱云霄","text":"四曲丹崖紫洞奇，玉函仙蜕记秦时。\n一从听断金鸡晓，花落空潭春自迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6957,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其六","author":"邱云霄","text":"五曲花开锦绣屏，青山无语静仪刑。\n楼前尽日东流水，独立苍茫晚对亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6958,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其七","author":"邱云霄","text":"六曲中流石灶寒，茶烟香湿紫苔斑。\n仙人饮罢留空鼎，拍掌岩头去不还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6959,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其八","author":"邱云霄","text":"七曲峰头松桂深，北廊岩下水云沈。\n玄猿白鹤闻清怨，久伴危冠合脱簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6960,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其九","author":"邱云霄","text":"八曲城高紫气浮，夜深仙乐响山头。\n到来钟鼓皆成石，怅倚斜晖望玉楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6961,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和棹歌 其十","author":"邱云霄","text":"九曲逶迤引市廛，人间天上别风烟。\n青蓑黄犊归来晚，疑是桃源学种田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6962,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田家杂兴 其一","author":"邱云霄","text":"晓日空林生紫烟，微风新长半池莲。\n人疑秦谷时通棹，俗近豳风只受田。\n开径逐门回石磴，傍厨凿井动山泉。\n白云一卧青山晚，梦落桑皋向远天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6963,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田家杂兴 其二","author":"邱云霄","text":"柳外莺声度翠微，轻裁白苧试新衣。\n深山岁月凭开落，浮世犁蓑无是非。\n江色净涵林气薄，雨光留湿石苔肥。\n青藜何处归来晚，满地月明乌鹊飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6964,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日田家杂兴 其三","author":"邱云霄","text":"疏篁箨落时惊犬，腐草光生欲化萤。\n断雨冥冥过垄去，乱流脉脉向田分。\n空斋有梦来蝴蝶，荒径无人下鹿群。\n长愿桑麻输早税，未应畎亩便忘君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6965,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"窗前种瓜数本采竹搆棚引阁其蔓且以蔽夏","author":"邱云霄","text":"露引藤须蔓，云分叶掌垂。\n碧光流小簟，寒色上疏篱。\n得月偏宜晚，开花不厌迟。\n赤乌飞满屋，巾服未曾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6966,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游超峰","author":"邱云霄","text":"独宿孤峰顶，高霞伴客游。\n花深藏石磴，云湿洗山楼。\n钟散千村晓，林涵六月秋。\n不知尘世外，何处是瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6967,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过杜清碧读书处","author":"邱云霄","text":"徵君何事隐崔嵬，乱世冠裳共草莱。\n碧嶂清江愁莫雨，寒花落叶漫荒台。\n石几半留苔欲没，庭松已老鹤还来。\n白云不断空流水，芳桂丛深春鸟哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6968,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陷石堂","author":"邱云霄","text":"五月山游兴每迟，桃花开遍武陵蹊。\n路当古木连云合，石上长萝半雨垂。\n斜引玉桥回碧洞，漫寻瑶草到疏篱。\n丹青古殿悲寥落，佛日无光壁藓滋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6969,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿天游用郑少谷韵","author":"邱云霄","text":"隐屏日薄孤亭晚，风急涛声起翠林。\n云湿万峰寒错落，月明长壑独冯临。\n山中岁候青鞋老，天上楼台紫雾深。\n几度武陵迷路客，桃花流水乱春浔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6970,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄方棠陵宪副","author":"邱云霄","text":"独上孤城意若何，梦随双鹤度烟萝。\n棠陵第宅青枫外，毛坞图书翠竹多。\n云谷无人骑马到，天涯何处断鸿过。\n山中憔悴无堪赠，惟有清池长芰荷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6971,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂","author":"邱云霄","text":"茅屋交林霭，秋斋坐夕曛。\n短墙分树色，落叶避鸡群。\n门设频栖雀，檐虚长宿云。\n丹砂思葛老，青简负明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6972,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送华生归富春","author":"邱云霄","text":"八月凉风吹桂花，天南游子忆还家。\n富春潮转渔矶近，分水云连鸟道斜。\n雪暗寒斋怜独梦，斗横深夜倚归楂。\n古来勋业多年少，好为清时惜物华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6973,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石泉山中","author":"邱云霄","text":"寒风振疏林，山中霰如豆。\n睡起开竹房，石泉动春候。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6974,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中雪","author":"邱云霄","text":"朔风卷寒云，空山雪深尺。\n日莫启柴荆，独见寻梅迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6975,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻箫","author":"邱云霄","text":"有客乘白云，引箫坐空翠。\n吹罢竟不言，背人度山去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6976,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"邱云霄","text":"浮生荏苒年光尽，旧业凄凉壮志违。\n醉里自怜伤古调，灯前儿舞试新衣。\n千家爆竹城闉莫，一箸柔蔬酒力微。\n白发总能知岁改，青山依旧对柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6977,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"邱云霄","text":"独立孤台感岁时，羞将短发弄朝曦。\n门垂柳眼窥春早，堂款山容坐午迟。\n醉共青蔬贫亦好，梦骑白鹤笑还疑。\n尊前细把梅花看，冷淡香心只自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6978,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中李傅竹见过走谢兼以送别","author":"邱云霄","text":"一春长卧独柴扉，门外深苔印屐肥。\n花径未劳题凤去，竹窗空自听莺啼。\n帆依返照江鸥下，秋薄寒云塞雁归。\n九曲风烟如有问，紫阳楼外草庵稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6979,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄蓝石桥","author":"邱云霄","text":"九曲溪头旧结邻，莺花遥度石桥春。\n孤槎有客时通汉，深谷无人更问秦。\n远托江湖忧永夜，虚生贫贱愧同辰。\n青芝白石聊堪煮，懒向长沮一问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6980,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄蓝三十六吾原","author":"邱云霄","text":"吾原烟树暗幽蹊，倚石看云意每迟。\n月满夜悬徐氏榻，草深春梦谢家池。\n莫将白日閒丘壑，转使青山吊杖藜。\n离索不堪成独立，愁听莺语到花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6981,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀蓝双涧池亭因寄","author":"邱云霄","text":"习池春早忆重游，画舫清宵月满钩。\n疏竹小桥红日薄，南山孤阁翠烟流。\n落花双涧流还合，野鸭春塘迥自由。\n客到暗知仙格长，人间何处问丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6982,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠林方岩","author":"邱云霄","text":"南服三山秀，方岩一世豪。\n风流凌晋魏，词藻数庄骚。\n夜气窥龙剑，春林拾凤毛。\n怜君怀白璧，犹自滞青袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6983,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游瑞岩寺","author":"邱云霄","text":"白发从渠长，青藜足漫游。\n鸟啼山寺出，风静木兰抽。\n晓径云初起，春山水自流。\n禅心何处觅，明月一潭幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6984,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登白塔","author":"邱云霄","text":"白塔开雄镇，清风入壮游。\n山光摇建水，烟景俯汀州。\n猿啸千年树，人来五月裘。\n受闻天上语，更上竹间楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6985,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂即事","author":"邱云霄","text":"曲径妨高盖，空庭足远岑。\n莺花自春候，城郭此山林。\n结竹聊垂屏，孤音且罢琴。\n白云随去住，碧草共期襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]